<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Make a thin mixture of prickly cactus pear and insect meat starter, ready to be cut and fermented in a barrel.-->
  <VBE_MakeTequilaMustFromPears.description>将仙人掌梨和昆虫肉发酵剂制成稀薄混合物，准备好切割并在桶中发酵。</VBE_MakeTequilaMustFromPears.description>
  <!--EN: Making tequila must.-->
  <VBE_MakeTequilaMustFromPears.jobString>制作龙舌兰酒必备。</VBE_MakeTequilaMustFromPears.jobString>
  <!--EN: make tequila must from prickly pear-->
  <VBE_MakeTequilaMustFromPears.label>用仙人掌制作龙舌兰酒</VBE_MakeTequilaMustFromPears.label>
  <!--EN: Make unfermented cider with a starter in an air-tight bottle. If left alone to develop the proper bacteria the end result will be a weak alcoholic beverage.-->
  <VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.description>用密封瓶中的发酵剂制作未发酵的苹果酒。如果不去培养适当的细菌，最终的结果将是一种淡酒精饮料。</VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.description>
  <!--EN: fruits-->
  <VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.ingredients.0.filter.customSummary>水果</VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.ingredients.0.filter.customSummary>
  <!--EN: Making unfermented cider.-->
  <VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.jobString>制作未发酵的苹果酒。</VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.jobString>
  <!--EN: make unfermented cider-->
  <VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.label>制作未发酵的苹果酒</VBE_MakeUnfermentedCider.label>
</LanguageData>
